title: Party Discussion
subtitle: The party press opens a debate on the line. Back one faction's theses.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussionPrep(Q); !}

#The KPD settled policy through theses: drafts published in the party
#press, debated in the districts and adopted by the Zentrale or a
#congress. Backing a rival faction's theses costs the leadership's own
#faction some patience, and once it is angry it will not allow it.
#Effects are in RF.discussion (rf_congress.js).

= Party Discussion

The *Rote Fahne* opens its pages to a discussion on the party's tasks. Each faction submits its theses, the district conferences debate them, and the Zentrale must say which it backs.

- @right
- @left
- @minor
- @center
- @ultra
- @stalin

@right
title: Back the theses of the Brandler Right.
subtitle: The united front and workers' governments. Strengthens the <span class="f-right">Right</span>; better relations with the SPD.
view-if: right_formed = 1 and right_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_right = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'right'); !}

The Zentrale endorses the Right's theses: win the Social Democratic workers, and wherever possible form workers' governments with the left of their party.

@left
title: Back the theses of the Fischer–Maslow Left.
subtitle: No coalitions, prepare the offensive. Strengthens the <span class="f-left">Left</span>; more readiness, cooler relations with the SPD.
view-if: left_formed = 1 and left_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_left = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'left'); !}

The Zentrale endorses the Left's theses: no coalitions with the reformists, and every effort to prepare the working class for the struggle for power.

@minor
title: Back the proposals of the minor currents.
subtitle: The factory councils first. Strengthens the <span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span>; more influence in the unions.
view-if: minor_formed = 1 and minor_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_minor = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'minor'); !}

The Zentrale takes up proposals from outside the big camps: put the factory councils at the centre of the party's work.

@center
title: Back the theses of the Middle Group.
subtitle: Unity and loyalty to the International. Strengthens the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>; calms every faction a little.
view-if: center_formed = 1 and center_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_center = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'center'); !}

The Zentrale endorses the Middle Group's call to close ranks.

@ultra
title: Back the theses of the Ultra-Left.
subtitle: A party that answers to the German workers. Strengthens the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>; more autonomy.
view-if: ultra_formed = 1 and ultra_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_ultra = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'ultra'); !}

The Zentrale endorses the Ultra-Left's demand for a party that decides for itself.

@stalin
title: Back the theses of the Thälmann circle.
subtitle: Loyalty to the International. Strengthens the <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann circle</span>; Moscow approves.
view-if: stalin_formed = 1 and stalin_expelled = 0
choose-if: pd_ok_stalin = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The leadership's own faction will not let the Zentrale back its rivals now.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.discussion(Q, 'stalin'); !}

The Zentrale endorses the Thälmann circle's call for discipline and loyalty to the International.
